@startuml create-task-sse
!theme plain
title Sequence — Создание задачи + real-time SSE broadcast (Current)

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam roundCorner 6

actor "User\n(browser tab A)" as A
actor "User\n(browser tab B)" as B
participant "Nitro\n(H3 router)" as Nitro
participant "tasks.service.ts" as Service
participant "withTenant\n(server/utils/db.ts)" as DB
database "Postgres 16\n(RLS)" as PG
participant "EventBus\n(in-process EventEmitter)" as Bus
participant "SSE hub\n(H3 createEventStream)" as SSE

== Предусловие: tab B уже подписан на SSE-поток ==
B -> Nitro : GET /api/workspaces/[id]/boards/[boardId]/stream\nAccept: text/event-stream
Nitro -> Nitro : requireAuth + getWorkspaceForUserOrThrow\n(membership check)
Nitro -> SSE : createEventStream(event)
SSE -> Bus : subscribeBoardEvents(boardId, handler)
SSE --> B : stream open\n(heartbeat ': ping' каждые 25 с)

== Основной сценарий: tab A создаёт задачу ==
A -> Nitro : POST /api/workspaces/[id]/boards/[boardId]/tasks\n{ columnId, title, description?, priority?, assigneeId? }
Nitro -> Nitro : getValidatedRouterParams (zod)\nreadValidatedBody (zod)
Nitro -> Nitro : in-handler guard:\nrequireAuth → user\ngetWorkspaceForUserOrThrow → role
Nitro -> Service : createTask({ workspaceId, boardId, ...body,\nactorId, actorRole })

Service -> Service : requireMinRole(actorRole, 'member')
Service -> DB : withTenant(workspaceId, tx)
DB -> PG : SELECT set_config('app.workspace_id', $1, true)
note right of PG : RLS активен:\nвсе SELECT/INSERT\nфильтруются по\napp.workspace_id

Service -> PG : SELECT COALESCE(MAX(position), -1) + 1\nFROM tasks WHERE board_id=$1 AND column_id=$2
PG --> Service : next position
Service -> PG : INSERT INTO tasks(workspace_id, board_id,\ncolumn_id, title, description, priority, ...)\nRETURNING *
PG --> Service : new task row
Service -> PG : INSERT INTO task_events(workspace_id, task_id,\nevent_type='task_created', from_column_id=null,\nto_column_id, actor_id, payload)
PG --> Service : event_id
note right of PG
  Транзакция охватывает task + task_events.
  Если упадёт запись audit-события —
  откатится и сама задача.
end note

Service -> DB : COMMIT
Service -> Bus : publishBoardEvent({ type: 'task.created',\nworkspaceId, boardId, payload: row })
note right of Service
  Publish ПОСЛЕ commit'а — никаких
  фантомных событий о задаче,
  которая могла откатиться.
end note

Bus -> SSE : emit на канале board:{boardId}\n(handler вызывается синхронно)
SSE --> B : event: task.created\ndata: { type, workspaceId, boardId, payload, ts }
B -> B : EventSource.onmessage:\ninvalidate tasks query

Service --> Nitro : new task
Nitro --> A : 201 Created\n{ task: {...} }
A -> A : @tanstack/vue-query:\ninvalidate tasks query

note over Bus, SSE
  In-process EventEmitter — работает только внутри
  одного Nitro-процесса (single instance в Current).
  Cross-node fan-out через pg LISTEN/NOTIFY — Target
  (см. [`docs/06-system-architecture.md`](../../06-system-architecture.md) → Target).
  Триггер эволюции: появление 2-й реплики Nitro.
end note

note over Nitro, Service
  Папок server/middleware/ и server/jobs/ нет —
  guards (requireAuth, getWorkspaceForUserOrThrow,
  requireMinRole) вызываются в первых строках
  handler'а (in-handler pattern).

  pg-boss / Telegram / Pachca / Caddy sticky cookies —
  Target (см. [`docs/06-system-architecture.md`](../../06-system-architecture.md) → Target).
end note

@enduml
